  "description": "Here in Australia we can’t get enough of fusion food. We’ve paired our Tunisian Harissa with Cypriot haloumi and a cheeky Mexican medley of kidney beans, corn and coriander. This dish is all about the adventurous spirit so pack a bag, throw caution to the wind and get to eating!",
